Name: string-cache
Short Name: string-cache
URL: https://github.com/servo/string-cache
Version: 0.11.0
Revision: 5f845e2cdf504e76a53d6827a6f6d4bfcced1c93
Update Mechanism: Manual (tools/import.py string-cache, history replayed linearly)
License: MIT OR Apache-2.0
License File: N/A (see the crate manifests)
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
A string interning library for Rust, developed as part of the Servo project.

Local Modifications:
The crates (3) live in third_party/string-cache/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by
tools/flatten.py (path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate) and patched by
tools/fixups.sh and tools/patches/. Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/string-cache/ unchanged.

Crates:
  string_cache 0.11.0 third_party/string-cache/string_cache
  integration_tests 0.0.1 third_party/string-cache/integration_tests
  string_cache_codegen 0.11.2 third_party/string-cache/string_cache_codegen
